    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BlockGame:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D fixed top view shooter, a total of three levels, you can choose one of the levels to play, you can't save the game progress, if you die, you need to start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode of operation: keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: W/S/A/D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting: Left mouse button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editing Team: 1/2/3/4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Full Screen/Window: F11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearance Conditions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Destroy the final boss of the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game End Conditions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Close the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: Don't go near any monsters, switch team forms on the fly to ensure more bullet coverage,Good luck.</p>",
